{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42176","headline":"寄江州萧给事 · 徐铉","name":"寄江州萧给事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夕郎忧国不忧身，今向天涯作逐臣。\n魂梦暗驰龙阙曙，啸吟闲绕虎谿春。\n朝车载酒过山寺，谏纸题诗寄野人。\n惆怅懦夫何足道，自离羣後已同尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}